# Cloudflare Workers static assets redirects
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/redirects/
# Supported: 301/302/303/307/308 redirects and 200 proxying.
# Not supported: domain-level (host) redirects — use Cloudflare Redirect Rules for apex↔www.
#
# Production uses run_worker_first: path aliases below are mirrored in src/worker.ts
# (Worker owns redirects when the Worker handles the request). Keep both in sync
# for asset-only previews that skip the Worker. Host-level 301s (www → apex) are
# Worker-only — see docs/CUSTOM-DOMAIN.md.

# —— Static aliases (must appear before dynamic rules) ——
